    "content": "Cassandra Kulukundis is the casting director for One Battle After Another (2025), directed by Paul Thomas Anderson. Known for her long-term collaboration with Anderson, she won the first-ever Academy Award for Best Casting in 2026 for this film, which features a cast including Leonardo DiCaprio, Sean Penn, and Teyana Taylor. Key Details About the Casting: The Search: Kulukundis is noted for extensive talent scouting, including visiting martial arts studios to find breakout star Chase Infiniti, who plays Willa. Methodology: She worked closely with Anderson to cast a mix of established stars (DiCaprio, Penn, Benicio del Toro) and unknowns, including local skateboarders in El Paso. Recognition: Her work on this film garnered her the inaugural SCAD Savannah Film Festival's Outstanding Achievement in Casting Award. Kulukundis has cast many of Paul Thomas Anderson’s films, including There Will Be Blood, Phantom Thread, and Licorice Pizza.",
